      content: `## Building Your First Portfolio\n\n### Step-by-Step Guide:\n\n**Step 1: Define Your Goal\n- What are you investing for?\n- What's your time horizon?\n\n**Step 2: Assess Risk Tolerance\n- How would you react to a 20% drop?\n- Can you afford to lose this money?\n\n**Step 3: Choose Your Allocation\n- **Conservative**: 70% Large-cap, 20% Mid-cap, 10% Small-cap\n- **Moderate**: 50% Large-cap, 30% Mid-cap, 20% Small-cap\n- **Aggressive**: 30% Large-cap, 40% Mid-cap, 30% Small-cap\n\n**Step 4: Select Stocks (or Funds)\n- Research companies\n- Check financials\n- Read analyst opinions\n\n**Step 5: Monitor & Rebalance\n- Review quarterly\n- Rebalance when allocation drifts\n- Stay informed\n\n### Common Mistakes to Avoid:\n- Investing based on tips alone\n- Panic selling during dips\n- Not diversifying\n- Trying to time the market\n- Ignoring transaction costs`
